{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pulls/2916","id":5468952194,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTIDrTc8AAAABRfmWgg","html_url":"https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pull/2916","diff_url":"https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pull/2916.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pull/2916.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/issues/2916","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pulls/2916/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pulls/2916/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/issues/2916/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/statuses/8112c24f1169b323c6a940d0c7541d94e4c06ce0","number":2916,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(tui): cancel a held burst Enter before Ctrl+T and Ctrl+G (#2407 item 2)","user":{"login":"citadelculture","id":209115483,"node_id":"U_kgDODHbZWw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209115483?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture","html_url":"https://github.com/citadelculture","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes item 2 of #2407 only (items 1 and 3 and #2405's raw-key grouping are out of scope).\n\n**Cause.** Ctrl+T (transcript) and Ctrl+G (external editor) are handled in `App::handle_key_event` and never reach `ChatWidget::handle_key_event`, which cancels a held burst Enter for every other Ctrl/Alt key. Inside the 32 ms lookahead:\n- Ctrl+T opened the overlay with the submission still armed, so the draft submitted on a later tick.\n- Ctrl+G seeded the editor from `composer_text_with_pending()`, which does not include the unmaterialized burst, so the draft was missing.\n\n**Change.** Both handlers first call a new `ChatWidget::cancel_pending_burst_submission()`, which delegates to the existing `BottomPane`/composer cancellation: it drops the held Enter and materializes the burst into the draft, the same thing a Ctrl/Alt key routed to ChatWidget does. Ctrl+G cancels even when the editor can't launch, because the key is consumed either way. Production diff: 7 lines in `app/input.rs` plus the 3-line passthrough. Everything else is `#[cfg(test)]`.\n\n**Tests** (`app/tests/held_enter_shortcuts.rs`, controlled clock: the burst and the held Enter are typed at a test-chosen `Instant` and the deadline is checked at `now + 1s`; the real keys go through `App::handle_key_event`):\n- `ctrl_t_transcript_cancels_held_enter_and_keeps_the_draft`: fails on base (Enter still armed), passes at head\n- `ctrl_g_editor_seeds_from_held_burst_and_cancels_its_enter`: fails on base (editor seed is empty), passes at head\n- controls: `held_burst_enter_submits_without_a_shortcut_control` (the armed Enter really submits) and `ctrl_t_with_ordinary_draft_leaves_it_unchanged`; both pass on base and head\n\n**Runs** (macOS 26 aarch64, Rust 1.99.1, `codex-rs/`):\n- `cargo test -p codex-tui --lib held_enter_shortcuts`: base 2 passed / 2 failed (exit 101); head 4 passed (exit 0)\n- `cargo test -p codex-tui --lib`: 4800 passed, 3 failed, none of them in input code:\n  - `status_snapshot_includes_enterprise_monthly_credit_limit` fails on base too: this Mac's de-CH locale renders `8'000`\n  - `rolling_rate_limit_snapshot_preserves_prior_individual_limit` fails on base too\n  - `sec_437_thread_settings_keep_the_aggressive_rows` passes alone at head 3/3 (and on base); it only fails inside the full parallel run\n- clippy `--tests -D warnings`: 0; fmt `--check`: 0\n\nNot run: Linux and Windows (left to CI), and a live terminal check of the real 32 ms timing.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-24T08:48:27Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:48:27Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1ba8da3fb09a8c5ecaecb0a417473ce991343114","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"citadelculture:fix/issue2407-held-enter-app-shortcuts","ref":"fix/issue2407-held-enter-app-shortcuts","repo":{"id":1388907652,"node_id":"R_kgDOUskMhA","name":"CorbanuTerminal","full_name":"citadelculture/CorbanuTerminal","owner":{"login":"citadelculture","id":209115483,"node_id":"U_kgDODHbZWw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209115483?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture","html_url":"https://github.com/citadelculture","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/citadelcu